e nicotine pouches?","ans":"<p>Nicotine pouches are 100% tobacco, smoke and vape-free flavourful pouches of nicotine. They sit between your lip and gums to give you a fresh nicotine experience for up to 30 minutes.<\/p>"}},"text_4aVx9q":{"type":"text","disabled":true,"settings":{"ques":"How do nicotine pouches work?","ans":"<p>Nicotine pouches are extremely easy to use. Follow our 3 step guide below:<br\/><br\/>Step 1 – POP<br\/>Pop the soft, white nicotine pouch under your lip and position it to the side for a more comfortable fit.<br\/><br\/>Step 2 – TINGLE<br\/>You will feel a tingling sensation on your gums and a release of flavour, this is normal and means the pouch is working. We recommend leaving the pouch in for up to 30 minutes.<br\/><br\/>Step 3 - DISCARD<br\/>When you’re done, discard of it in the general waste or store in the top of the can.<br\/><br\/>Übbs Tobacco Free-Nicotine Pouches are designed to be absorbed through the gums and should not be swallowed. If you swallow a pouch and feel unwell, seek medical advice with the can or label at hand.<\/p>"}},"text_xVfGQj":{"type":"text","disabled":true,"settings":{"ques":"How long should I keep nicotine pouches in for?","ans":"<p>We recommend you keep a nicotine pouch in for up to 30 minutes.<\/p>"}},"text_ePGqpN":{"type":"text","disabled":true,"settings":{"ques":"Is Übbs the same as snus?","ans":"<p>No, Übbs Nicotine Pouches are not the same as snus. While they’re used in a similar way to snus, nicotine pouches are 100% tobacco-free unlike snus which contains tobacco.<\/p>"}},"text_fDta4K":{"type":"text","disabled":true,"settings":{"ques":"Who can use Übbs?","ans":"<p>Übbs contains nicotine and are to be used by existing smokers, vapers and nicotine consumers who are aged 18 or over.<br\/><br\/>Übbs is not to be used if you are under the age of 18, not an existing tobacco and nicotine consumer, allergic to nicotine and any other ingredients, pregnant\/breast-feeding or are suffering from an unstable heart condition, severe hypertension or diabetes.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["text_cHcPiM","text_JaTjtj","text_4aVx9q","text_xVfGQj","text_ePGqpN","text_fDta4K"],"name":"FAQ section","settings":{"heading":"common FAQ's"}},"16582928855dc3dfa2":{"type":"image_with_text_section","blocks":{"56502c04-5fd1-4644-9651-87995b052c27":{"type":"text","settings":{"list_item":"Over 18 years of age."}},"5e7573de-18ef-437a-863d-78ef2062b2e5":{"type":"text","settings":{"list_item":"Not pregnant, nursing or susceptible to cardiovascular disease."}},"62b46be2-857f-4818-adcb-a8cf176abc0e":{"type":"text","settings":{"list_item":"Aware that nicotine is a highly addictive substance."}},"118cb823-0968-410c-aec2-f599e71a3a9a":{"type":"text","settings":{"list_item":"An existing smoker or vaper."}}},"block_order":["56502c04-5fd1-4644-9651-87995b052c27","5e7573de-18ef-437a-863d-78ef2062b2e5","62b46be2-857f-4818-adcb-a8cf176abc0e","118cb823-0968-410c-aec2-f599e71a3a9a"],"settings":{"title":"ONLY USE ÜBBS IF YOU ARE:","subtitle":"","btn_url":"shopify:\/\/pages\/faqs","btn_label":"Learn More","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Hand-Held-Mock_4fc003f9-aa10-4eaf-a699-3277a140e15e.png"}},"1658293032100acacb":{"type":"newsletter","blocks":{"16582930325e82b82f-1":{"type":"paragraph","settings":{"text":"<p>FOR THE LATEST NEWS AND UPDATES<\/p>"}},"16582930325e82b82f-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"JOIN OUR NEWSLETTER","heading_size":"h0"}},"16582930325e82b82f-2":{"type":"email_form","settings":{}},"info_3FAxi6":{"type":"info","settings":{"btn_label":"","btn_url":""}}},"block_order":["16582930325e82b82f-1","16582930325e82b82f-0","16582930325e82b82f-2","info_3FAxi6"],"settings":{"color_scheme":"background-2","full_width":true,"padding_top":40,"padding_bottom":52}}},"order":["1658291420627c530a","banner_tefqG7","custom_collection_banner_zLMzN9","collection_banner_section_ATn6e8","banner","product-grid","seo_content_bQ3iez","a37b5717-fb3f-4690-89b7-198a43e4417a","below_fold_copy_Dkdatx","featured_blog_nn